html\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\">HTML<\/a> or <a href=\\\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/css\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\">CSS<\/a> to succeed in most digital marketing roles.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-does-it-take-to-learn-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1781268589362\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-does-it-take-to-learn-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1781268589362\",\"name\":\"4. Which digital marketing skill should I learn first?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Start with SEO and content marketing. These skills build the foundation for everything else. They teach you how people search and what kind of content attracts attention, which makes every other marketing channel easier to understand.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-does-it-take-to-learn-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1781268604064\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-does-it-take-to-learn-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1781268604064\",\"name\":\"5. Is one month enough to learn digital marketing?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"One month is enough to understand the basics, but not enough to be job-ready or professional. Think of the first month as your orientation phase, where you get comfortable with the landscape.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-does-it-take-to-learn-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1781268617320\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-does-it-take-to-learn-digital-marketing\/#faq-question-1781268617320\",\"name\":\"6. What is 